WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.734 line:92% size:92%
Underground, nematodes attack your crop's root.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000 line:92% size:92%
But an ally arrives: a beneficial fungus that hunts nematodes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.370 line:92% size:92%
Its spores infect the nematode's eggs and females, and control it from within.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.379 line:92% size:92%
It is curative: it acts when the pest is already at the root.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.213 line:92% size:92%
And it is preventive: applied earlier, it protects the root before the pest arrives.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.885 line:92% size:92%
This is NANO-STEEL 10GW, a microbial nematicide.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:36.169 line:92% size:92%
Its secret: a water-soluble gel that protects the spores for up to two years.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.808 line:92% size:92%
In other formulations, the spores sink to the bottom, stay suspended or compact.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.877 line:92% size:92%
With NANO-STEEL, they stay throughout the container: every dose carries the same.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.248 line:92% size:92%
Easy to apply, zero days of residue and no resistance build-up.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.243 line:92% size:92%
NANO-STEEL, by Demeter. Certified organic.
